---
const quick = `curl -fsSL https://ferry.designxdevelop.com/install.sh | bash`;
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="kicker">Open source · MIT</span>
      <h1>Your Cursor models,<br />in <span class="accent">OpenCode</span>.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Model Ferry is a loopback-only bridge that syncs Cursor's full model catalog — reasoning,
        effort, context, and fast presets — into OpenCode as native variants.
      </p>

      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn primary" href="#install">Install</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="https://github.com/designxdevelop/model-ferry" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
      </div>

      <div class="code">
        <div class="bar"><span class="title">install</span><button class="copy" data-copy="#hero-install" type="button">Copy</button></div>
        <pre><span class="cmt"># install the bridge, sign in, and launch it</span>
<span id="hero-install">{quick}</span></pre>
      </div>

      <p class="hint">
        Then pick the <strong>Cursor</strong> provider in OpenCode and choose a model — the models just show up in the picker.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; padding: 128px 0 112px; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 480px at 50% -10%, rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.12), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 100% 100%, 44px 44px, 44px 44px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(700px 420px at 50% 0%, black, transparent 75%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(700px 420px at 50% 0%, black, transparent 75%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero .container { position: relative; }
  .inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
  .inner h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 68px); font-weight: 700; }
  .inner h1 .accent { color: var(--accent); }
  .lede { margin: 24px auto 36px; max-width: 600px; font-size: 18px; color: var(--muted); }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }

  .code { width: 100%; max-width: 640px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--bg-soft); box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); overflow: hidden; }
  .bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .bar .title { font-size: 12px; color: var(--faint); font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; }
  .bar .copy { margin-left: auto; }
  .code pre { margin: 0; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #d7d7db; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; text-align: left; }
  .code .cmt { color: var(--faint); }
  .hint { margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--faint); }
  .hint strong { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero { padding: 96px 0 80px; }
  }
</style>
